            "description": "Check in the authenticated employee.\n\n`latitude` and `longitude` are required when GPS validation is enabled in API Settings.\n\n**Error codes:**\n- `409 ALREADY_CHECKED_IN` — open attendance already exists\n- `403 GEOFENCE_VIOLATION` — outside all active geofence zones"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "201 Created",
              "status": "Created",
              "code": 201,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"attendance_id\": 101,\n    \"check_in\": \"2024-06-01T08:00:00\",\n    \"geofence_message\": \"Within zone — 42m from centre\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "403 GEOFENCE_VIOLATION",
              "status": "Forbidden",
              "code": 403,
